      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUTUMN GLOW (4) champion mare undefeated second up and at this trip. Returned to her devastating best when she won with plenty up the sleeve over 1400m in the G1 Winx Stakes at this track. That form has since been franked with Sheza Alibi winning the G1 Maybe Diva last week. Too classy for this lot. GRINGOTTS (2) bounced off his good trial win with a tough first-up third in the G1 Winx Stakes. Has a sound second-up record and since fitted with a 1030m trial placing. Can secure a minor placing. CEOLWULF (1) third up for this and didn't get the conditions to suit with a slashing second in the G2 Chelmsford Stakes over this track and trip. Awkward set-up for this and look for him next start. IDLE FLYER (6) doesn't appear to be going as well this preparation and today will determine the path the stables will take over the coming month.",
